<title>USA: TABLE-Chico's June same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Chico's June same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MYERS, Fla. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			 1997	 1996	 Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $8.1	 $6.0     +34.5	+14.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date     $37.6	$28.7     +13.5	 +2.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is five weeks ended July 5.</p>
<p>Full company name is Chico's FAS Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Included in the total sales for the month of June, but excluded from comparable stores sales, is a one-time bulk sale of about $464,000 of prior year's merchandise which was sold at a sale price roughly equal to cost.</p>
</text>
